    <!-- ABOUT SECTION HERE -->
    <div id="about" class="custom_row section">
        <p class="mobileTitle">About</p>
        Hi! My name is Anna Maria Alikakou and i based in Athens, Greece!
        <br><br>I am a Junior Web Developer with hands-on experience in building responsive, user-friendly websites using modern web technologies. I specialize in frontend development and WordPress, creating custom themes and layouts with a strong focus on clean code, performance, and usability
        <br><br>My core skill set includes HTML5, CSS (SCSS/LESS), JavaScript, PHP, jQuery and Bootstrap 5. I have experience developing custom WordPress websites, implementing SEO best practices, and working with basic server configurations.
        <br><br>In addition to my current experience, I am actively expanding my knowledge in backend and full-stack development. I am learning how to work with APIs, databases, SQL and PostgreSQL, as well as modern JavaScript frameworks and tools such as React.js, Node.js, and Express.js. I’m also exploring authentication systems and application architecture to better understand how complete web applications are built.
        <br><br>I enjoy working in collaborative environments and take pride in writing maintainable, well-structured code. I’m highly motivated to continue learning, improve my technical skills, and contribute to meaningful projects that deliver real value to users.
